      "blurb": "Solitary vorcha living by wits and scavenging",
      "publicNotes": "<p>Not every vorcha is a pack-running killer. Scroungers are the loners - too weak, too clever, or too tired of pack politics to run with the group. They haunt back alleys, derelict ships, and abandoned stations, picking over the leavings of more powerful beings. Their rapid cellular adaptation keeps them alive where others would perish, and they know how to make themselves scarce.</p><p><strong>Adaptive Healing:</strong> The scrounger regains 5 HP at the start of each of their turns (fast healing 5).</p>",
